            "liquid": "{% comment %}\n  Gift Banner Block - Place above Add to Cart Button\n  This block creates a promotional banner with a gift bow icon on the left\n  Width matches the add to cart button container\n  \n  IMPORTANT: Replace the image URL with your actual ribbon image URL after uploading to Shopify Files\n{% endcomment %}\n\n<style>\n  .gift-banner-container {\n    background-color: #F1EADE;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 10px 14px 10px 45px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n    width: 100%;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n    min-height: 50px;\n  }\n\n  \/* Vertical Ribbon Container *\/\n  .gift-ribbon-vertical {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 8px;\n    top: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    width: 28px;\n    height: 100%;\n    z-index: 2;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n\n  .ribbon-image {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    max-height: 100%;\n    object-fit: contain;\n    object-position: center;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n  }\n\n  .gift-banner-text {\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    font-weight: 500;\n  }\n\n  .gift-banner-text .highlight {\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #d32f2f;\n  }\n\n  \/* Add subtle animation on hover *\/\n  .gift-banner-container:hover {\n    background-color: #F1EADE;\n    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;\n  }\n\n  \/* Responsive adjustments *\/\n  @media (max-width: 749px) {\n    .gift-banner-container {\n      padding: 8px 10px 8px 38px;\n      min-height: 45px;\n    }\n    \n    .gift-ribbon-vertical {\n      left: 6px;\n      top: 0;\n      bottom: 0;\n      width: 25px;\n      height: 100%;\n    }\n    \n    .gift-banner-text {\n      font-size: 12px;\n    }\n  }\n<\/style>\n\n<div class=\"gift-banner-container\">\n  <!-- Vertical Ribbon with Bow -->\n  <div class=\"gift-ribbon-vertical\">\n    <img \n      src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0930\/4218\/0471\/files\/Untitled_design_65.png?v=1762089154\" \n      alt=\"Gift Ribbon\" \n      class=\"ribbon-image\"\n      loading=\"lazy\"\n      onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"\n    \/>\n  <\/div>\n  \n  <div class=\"gift-banner-text\">\n    <span class=\"highlight\">BLACK FRIDAY SALE 🔥<\/span><br>\n    GET 4, PAY FOR 2<\/span><br>\n🔥 PLUS, Subscribe & Save to unlock an additional <span class=\"highlight\">20% OFF<\/span>.\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n{% comment %}\n  Alternative version with simpler text (uncomment to use):\n  \n  <div class=\"gift-banner-container\">\n    <div class=\"gift-ribbon-vertical\">\n      <img \n        src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0930\/4218\/0471\/files\/Untitled_design_65.png?v=1762089154\" \n        alt=\"Gift Ribbon\" \n        class=\"ribbon-image\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      \/>\n    <\/div>\n    \n    <div class=\"gift-banner-text\">\n      Hear what matters, protect what's priceless.\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n{% endcomment %}\n\n{% comment %}\n  IMPLEMENTATION INSTRUCTIONS:\n  \n  1. Upload the ribbon image to Shopify:\n     - Go to Settings > Files\n     - Upload your vertical ribbon bow image\n     - Copy the URL of the uploaded image\n  \n  2. Replace the image URL:\n     - Find this line: src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/YOUR-STORE\/files\/vertical-ribbon-bow.png?v=1234567890\"\n     - Replace with your actual uploaded image URL\n  \n  3. In your Shopify theme, create a new snippet:\n     - Go to Online Store > Themes > Actions > Edit code\n     - Under \"Snippets\", click \"Add a new snippet\"\n     - Name it \"gift-banner-block\" and paste this code\n  \n  4. Add to your product template above the add to cart button:\n     {% render 'gift-banner-block' %}\n  \n  5. Or add directly in the product form:\n     - Find your product-template.liquid or main-product.liquid\n     - Locate the add to cart button (usually has class like \"product-form__buttons\")\n     - Add the render tag just above it\n  \n  6. To customize the message, you can pass variables:\n     {% render 'gift-banner-block', \n        headline: 'Special Offer!',\n        message: 'Limited time discount available',\n        ribbon_image: 'YOUR_IMAGE_URL_HERE'\n     %}\n{% endcomment %}\n\n{% comment %}\n  Version with customizable parameters:\n{% endcomment %}\n\n{% if headline or message %}\n  <div class=\"gift-banner-container\">\n    <div class=\"gift-ribbon-vertical\">\n      <img \n        src=\"{{ ribbon_image | default: 'https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0930\/4218\/0471\/files\/Untitled_design_65.png?v=1762089154' }}\" \n        alt=\"Gift Ribbon\" \n        class=\"ribbon-image\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      \/>\n    <\/div>\n    \n    <div class=\"gift-banner-text\">\n      {% if headline %}<span class=\"highlight\">{{ headline }}<\/span><br>{% endif %}\n      {% if message %}{{ message }}{% endif %}\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n{% endif %}"
          }
