            "content": "<p>Mucuna Pruiens Extract 12mg, 5-HTP 5mg, Lion's Mane Mushroom Extract 4.5mg, Rhodiola Extract 3.5mg<br\/><\/p><p><\/p><p><\/p><p><\/p>",
